Package: zoomriya-installer
Version: 13.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ZOOMRIYA <os@zoomriya.com>
Depends: sway, python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, fonts-inter,
 adwaita-icon-theme, librsvg2-common, libpam-systemd, systemd, systemd-repart, btrfs-progs, efibootmgr,
 util-linux, udev, systemd-resolved
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ZOOMRIYA OS installer, on the USB stick
 A full-screen app on the computer's own screen (sway, locked to it): checks the
 computer, lets the person choose the drive, shows the drive before and after,
 then writes ZOOMRIYA OS to it with the factory's partitions. It looks for the
 internet, but installs without it. Only on the USB installer (mkosi/installer),
 never on a box.
